OL,3,GNEWSAReform could scrap climate
OL,4,Aemergency declaration
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK is proposing to ditch a
OL,7,Fcouncil's declaration of a "Climate and
OL,8,FEnvironment Emergency" that was made
OL,9,Ffive years ago.
OL,11,FJust months after North
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire Council was
OL,13,Festablished in 2021, the authority,
OL,14,Fthen Conservative-run, declared a
OL,15,Fclimate emergency.
OL,17,FLeon Gibbs, a Reform councillor who has
OL,18,Fproposed the new motion, said: "We
OL,19,Fdon't believe it makes sense to say
OL,20,Fthat we're operating in a state of
OL,21,Femergency while simultaneously working
OL,22,Ftowards a target 24 years away."
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
