OL,3,GNEWSAReform could scrap climate
OL,4,Aemergency declaration
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative, Labour and Green
OL,7,Fopposition councillors have all
OL,8,Fcriticised the move ahead of Thursday
OL,9,Fevening's vote.
